---
import PageHeadText from '../components/PageHeadText.astro';
import WideImageHero from '../components/WideImageHero.astro';
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

import image from '../assets/soap.png';
import image1 from '../assets/fragrance.jpg';
import image2 from '../assets/kojic.jpeg';
import image3 from '../assets/aloevera.jpg';
---

<Layout title='About'>
	<div class="container">
        <PageHeadText title='Noore' subtitle='ABOUT' />

        <WideImageHero url={image} alt='Aloe Vera' leftToRight={false}>
            <p>
                Noore began with a simple idea: creating products that bring a little more intention to everyday routines.
            </p>
            <p>
                Growing up, self-care wasn't something that came in elaborate packaging or complicated routines. It was homemade haldi masks before weddings, honey and lemon mixed in kitchen bowls, coconut oil rituals on Sunday afternoons, and ingredients passed down through generations long before they became beauty trends.
            </p>
        </WideImageHero>
        <WideImageHero url={image1} alt='Aloe Vera' leftToRight={true}>
            <p>
                Those memories became the inspiration behind Noore.
            </p>
            <p>
                Every bar is handcrafted in small batches using thoughtfully selected ingredients, chosen not only for their qualities but for the feeling they create — comfort, calm, freshness, warmth and a moment of pause in a busy day.
            </p>
        </WideImageHero>
        <WideImageHero url={image2} alt='Aloe Vera' leftToRight={false}>
            <p>
                We believe self-care doesn't need to be complicated. Sometimes it's as simple as a beautifully made bar of soap, a familiar scent, or a few quiet moments carved out for yourself. 
            </p>
            <p>
                Noore is our way of bringing together traditional inspirations and modern rituals, creating products that feel personal, comforting and made with care.
            </p>
        </WideImageHero>
        <WideImageHero url={image3} alt='Aloe Vera' leftToRight={true}>
            <p>
                Thank you for supporting a small handmade business and being part of this journey 💜
            </p>
        </WideImageHero>

    </div>
</Layout>

<style>
    
    h1, p {
        margin: 0px;
        padding: 0px;
    }

    @media (orientation: landscape) {
        
    }

    @media (orientation: portrait) {
        .container {
            margin-bottom: 5rem;
        }
    }
</style>
